Package: libavdevice-dev
Version: @DEB_FFMPEG_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Development
Priority: optional
Depends: libavdevice59 (= @DEB_FFMPEG_V@), libavformat-dev (= @DEB_FFMPEG_V@), libavcodec-dev (= @DEB_FFMPEG_V@), libavfilter-dev (= @DEB_FFMPEG_V@), libavutil-dev (= @DEB_FFMPEG_V@)
Description: FFmpeg device handling library - development
